@startuml Saga_PaymentFailed
title Saga-хореография: ошибка оплаты → компенсация резервирования

participant "Event Bus" as Bus
participant "Payment Service" as Payment
participant "Inventory Service" as Inventory
participant "Order Service" as Order
participant "Notification Service" as Notify

== Предыдущие шаги: OrderCreated → InventoryReserved ==

Bus -> Payment: InventoryReserved
activate Payment
Payment -> Payment: Попытка списания
Payment -> Bus: **PaymentFailed** (недостаточно средств)
deactivate Payment

Bus -> Inventory: PaymentFailed
activate Inventory
Inventory -> Inventory: Освободить зарезервированные товары
Inventory -> Bus: **InventoryReleased** (compensation)
deactivate Inventory

Bus -> Order: PaymentFailed
activate Order
Order -> Order: Статус → CANCELLED
Order -> Bus: **OrderCancelled**
deactivate Order

Bus -> Notify: OrderCancelled
activate Notify
Notify -> Customer: Push: «Заказ отменён: ошибка оплаты»
deactivate Notify
@enduml